        "code": "// Calls dropdownMenu1's actions and reads its values by name, as RunJS code in a saved app does.\nawait components.dropdownMenu1.open();\nawait components.dropdownMenu1.close();\nawait components.dropdownMenu1.setLoading(true);\nawait components.dropdownMenu1.setLoading(false);\nawait components.dropdownMenu1.setDisable(true);\nawait components.dropdownMenu1.setDisable(false);\nawait components.dropdownMenu1.setVisibility(false);\nawait components.dropdownMenu1.setVisibility(true);\nreturn { \"isVisible\": components.dropdownMenu1.isVisible, \"isLoading\": components.dropdownMenu1.isLoading, \"isDisabled\": components.dropdownMenu1.isDisabled, \"lastClickedOption\": components.dropdownMenu1.lastClickedOption, \"isOpen\": components.dropdownMenu1.isOpen };",
